{
 "file": "06BLK07L base 0x5000",
 "entries": [
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:40",
   "ptr": "0x40",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "「古文書に検閲を加えた貴族は、《黒竜》\\n",
   "en": "\"The nobles who censored the ancient documents seem to have known how to block the Black Dragon's Wave, and cut it out. If not for that, our research would be much further along... Thanks to them, we had to grope for defenses against the Wave from scratch. Without Riel, I shudder to think where we'd be.\"",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:6b",
   "ptr": "0x6b",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　の波動を防ぐ方法をある程度知った上\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:40"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:94",
   "ptr": "0x94",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "　で、その部分を削除したようだ。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:40"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:ba",
   "ptr": "0xba",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "  彼らがそんなことさえしなければ、\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:40"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:e1",
   "ptr": "0xe1",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "　我々の研究は今より遥かに進んだ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:40"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:106",
   "ptr": "0x106",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "　ものになってたのに・・・\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:40"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:126",
   "ptr": "0x126",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　おかげで、波動の対策も、１から手探\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:40"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:14f",
   "ptr": "0x14f",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "　りで進めねばならなかった。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:40"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:170",
   "ptr": "0x170",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　もし、我々にリールがいなかったらと\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　りで進めねばならなかった。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:40"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:199",
   "ptr": "0x199",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "　思うと、ゾッとするよ」\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:40"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:1b9",
   "ptr": "0x1b9",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "「情報や研究の成果を、上の者だけが\\n",
   "en": "\"When only those at the top get to hoard information and research results, scholars just drift further from the world. I don't want things to go that way ever again.\"",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:1e0",
   "ptr": "0x1e0",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　独占するような仕組みでは、学者は\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:1b9"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:207",
   "ptr": "0x207",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "　世間から離れていく一方だ。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:1b9"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:229",
   "ptr": "0x229",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　もう、そういうことには、なりたく\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:1b9"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:250",
   "ptr": "0x250",
   "len": 12,
   "jp": "　ないね」\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 12,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:1b9"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:282",
   "ptr": "0x282",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "「カイエスさん、シノブさん。\\n",
   "en": "\"Caius-san, Shinobu-san. I was just about to go looking for you both.",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:2a3",
   "ptr": "0x2a3",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　今、おふたりを捜しに行こうと思って\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:282"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:2cc",
   "ptr": "0x2cc",
   "len": 14,
   "jp": "　たんです。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 14,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:282"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:2de",
   "ptr": "0x2de",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　ずいぶん時間がかかってしまいました\\n",
   "en": "It took a very long time, but I've finally found a way to block the Black Dragon's Wave.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:307",
   "ptr": "0x307",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  が、ようやく、《黒竜》の波動を防ぐ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:2de"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:330",
   "ptr": "0x330",
   "len": 24,
   "jp": "  方法がわかりました」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 24,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:2de"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:358",
   "ptr": "0x358",
   "len": 22,
   "jp": "「すごいじゃない！」\\f",
   "en": "\"That's amazing!\"",
   "max": 22,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:37e",
   "ptr": "0x37e",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "「それで、その方法は？」\\f",
   "en": "\"So, what's the method?\"",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:3a8",
   "ptr": "0x3a8",
   "len": 22,
   "jp": "「毒には毒を、です。\\n",
   "en": "\"Poison against poison. The Black Dragon's Wave and the Black Ore's wave repel each other.\"",
   "max": 22,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:3c1",
   "ptr": "0x3c1",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  《黒竜》の波動は、あの《黒い鉱石》\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:3a8"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:3ea",
   "ptr": "0x3ea",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "  の波動と反発するんです」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:3a8"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:416",
   "ptr": "0x416",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "「《黒い鉱石》と波動が？\\n",
   "en": "\"The Black Ore and the Wave? Weren't they both the same poison?\"",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:433",
   "ptr": "0x433",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　どっちも同じ毒じゃなかったの？」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:416"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:467",
   "ptr": "0x467",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "「いえ、毒素として見れば同じで、\\n",
   "en": "\"Well, as toxins they're the same, and their effects are the same too, but...",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:48c",
   "ptr": "0x48c",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "　その及ぼす効果も同じなんです\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:467"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:4af",
   "ptr": "0x4af",
   "len": 12,
   "jp": "　が・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 12,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:467"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:4bf",
   "ptr": "0x4bf",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　そう！　磁石のＳ極とＮ極が反発する\\n",
   "en": "Yes! Think of it like the S and N poles of a magnet repelling each other, and you'll be close!\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:4e8",
   "ptr": "0x4e8",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　ような感じと、思っていただければ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:4bf"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:50f",
   "ptr": "0x50f",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "　近いです！」\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:4bf"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:52f",
   "ptr": "0x52f",
   "len": 12,
   "jp": "「う～ん、\\n",
   "en": "\"Hmmm... I think I sort of get it...\"",
   "max": 12,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:53e",
   "ptr": "0x53e",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "  なんとなく解ったような・・・」\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:52f"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:570",
   "ptr": "0x570",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "「しかし、あんなモノを身につけて\\n",
   "en": "\"But if we wore that stuff, the ore's poison would get us instead.\"",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:595",
   "ptr": "0x595",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "　いては、今度は鉱石の毒にやられ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:570"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:5ba",
   "ptr": "0x5ba",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "　てしまうぞ」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:570"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:5da",
   "ptr": "0x5da",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "「《黒い鉱石》の発してる波動に、\\n",
   "en": "\"If we could make the wave the Black Ore gives off point in one direction...",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:5ff",
   "ptr": "0x5ff",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "　指向性を持たせることができれば・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:5da"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:62b",
   "ptr": "0x62b",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　なんとか、使えるようにと、努力して\\n",
   "en": "I'm working hard to make it usable somehow, but given what it is, so far...\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:654",
   "ptr": "0x654",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　いるんですが、物が物ですから、今の\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:62b"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:67d",
   "ptr": "0x67d",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "　ところ・・・」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:62b"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:69f",
   "ptr": "0x69f",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「《黒い鉱石》で防具でも作ると言うの\\n",
   "en": "\"You mean to make armor out of the Black Ore?\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:6c8",
   "ptr": "0x6c8",
   "len": 10,
   "jp": "  か？」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 10,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:69f"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:6e2",
   "ptr": "0x6e2",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "「身につけてる者には影響を与えず、\\n",
   "en": "\"I want it to cancel out the Black Dragon's Wave without affecting the one who wears it.\"",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:709",
   "ptr": "0x709",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "　《黒竜》の波動を相殺してくれる\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:6e2"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:72e",
   "ptr": "0x72e",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "　効果を出したいんです」\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:6e2"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:758",
   "ptr": "0x758",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "「毒には毒・・・\\n",
   "en": "\"Poison against poison... Perhaps we should go ask an expert on poison.\"",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:76d",
   "ptr": "0x76d",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　毒の専門家にでも、聞きに行ってみる\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:758"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:796",
   "ptr": "0x796",
   "len": 8,
   "jp": "　か」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 8,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:758"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:7b0",
   "ptr": "0x7b0",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「《黒い鉱石》のことで、何か知ってる\\n",
   "en": "\"If only there were someone who knew something about the Black Ore...\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:7d9",
   "ptr": "0x7d9",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　人がいると助かるんですが・・・」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:7b0"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:806",
   "ptr": "0x806",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "「貴族出身の学者たちは、みんな船に\\n",
   "en": "\"The scholars of noble birth all left to board the ships. All that's left are self-made folk like us.\"",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:82d",
   "ptr": "0x82d",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "　乗るために去って行ったよ。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:806"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:84e",
   "ptr": "0x84e",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "　残ったのは叩き上げの奴らばっかりさ」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　乗るために去って行ったよ。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:806"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:887",
   "ptr": "0x887",
   "len": 36,
