   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:10c0"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:1135",
   "ptr": "0x1135",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "　だってそうでしょう？　今までずっと、\\n",
   "en": "I mean, wouldn't you? We looked down on them all this time, we did.",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:1160",
   "ptr": "0x1160",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "　あいつらを蔑んでいたんですよ、\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:1135"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:1185",
   "ptr": "0x1185",
   "len": 12,
   "jp": "　私らは。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 12,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:1135"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:1195",
   "ptr": "0x1195",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  今さら、仲良くやっていこうなんて、\\n",
