   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:11be",
   "ptr": "0x11be",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "  とても・・・」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:1195"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:11d6",
   "ptr": "0x11d6",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「国が無くなってしまった以上、みんな\\n",
   "en": "\"Now that the country's gone, we all have to help each other... I know that in my head, but still...\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:11ff",
   "ptr": "0x11ff",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "  で助け合わなきゃならない・・・\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:11d6"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:1224",
   "ptr": "0x1224",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　頭では分かってるんですけどねェ」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:11d6"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:1259",
   "ptr": "0x1259",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "「変身してないけど、ぼくは辺境の者\\n",
   "en": "\"I haven't transformed, but I'm one of the frontier folk.",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:1280",
   "ptr": "0x1280",
   "len": 10,
   "jp": "  です。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 10,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:1259"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:128e",
   "ptr": "0x128e",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　確かに、移民の中にもいい人はいて、\\n",
   "en": "There are good people among the settlers too, it's true, and thanks to them I got out of jail, but...",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:12b7",
   "ptr": "0x12b7",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　その人たちのおかげで牢から出られた\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:128e"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:12e0",
   "ptr": "0x12e0",
   "len": 20,
   "jp": "　わけですが・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
