   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:128e"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:12f8",
   "ptr": "0x12f8",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　彼らが今まで、ぼくらにやったことを\\n",
   "en": "when I think of what they've done to us all this time, I can't quite be glad about it.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:1321",
   "ptr": "0x1321",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　考えると、もうひとつ素直に喜べませ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:12f8"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:134a",
   "ptr": "0x134a",
   "len": 8,
   "jp": "　ん。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 8,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:12f8"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:1356",
   "ptr": "0x1356",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　今は《黒竜》という共通の敵がいる\\n",
   "en": "Right now we share a common enemy, the Black Dragon, so we can live in one city like this. But if the Black Dragon were gone...",
