   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:13e5"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:1422",
   "ptr": "0x1422",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　いや、これこそ、あなたがたには関係\\n",
   "en": "No, this really is no concern of yours, is it...",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:144b",
   "ptr": "0x144b",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "　のない話でしたね・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07L:1422"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07L:1469",
   "ptr": "0x1469",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　神話とか、伝説とか呼ばれる物語が、\\n",
